        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Embroidered Coffer or Box\nSpanish; late seventeenth century\nEmbroidered in silks\nGiven by Señor Piaño [sic]\n1007-1873\n\nA professionally embroidered chest made as a presentation piece. Although intended to be shown, it would have contained valuables of all kinds including documents. [circa 1998]"@en ;
